<title>DENMARK: Great Belt raises 4 pct bond offer to 750 mln Dkk.</title>
<headline>Great Belt raises 4 pct bond offer to 750 mln Dkk.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Great Belt bridge and tunnel consortium on Thursday raised a four percent bond offer announced earlier in November to 750 million crowns, from its original 500 million, arranger Den Danske Bank said.</p>
<p>A statement from Den Danske said that the new bonds, guaranteed by the bank, would be on sale at its branches from November 25.</p>
<p>A separate four percent Great Belt bond, arranged by Unibank, was announced earlier on Friday.</p>
